    <briefdescription>
<para>Wrapper for a TrueType font using SDL_ttf. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class manages loading a font from a file and rendering text to OpenGL textures. It supports setting font size and style.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The font is loaded from a TTF file and rendered to SDL_Surface, which can then be converted to an OpenGL texture. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classTexture2D" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
